  "schemaVersion": "v0.0.1:client-agent-version-ranges-1",
  "note": [
    "One row per Agent whose installed version this Host probes. A row declares",
    "the version domains its own probe reports and the ranges that admit or are",
    "refused. A row with no supported range declares no bound: this repository",
    "states no vendor minimum it has not verified, so a bound is added together",
    "with the evidence for it, and until then only a version the probe cannot",
    "compare is refused."
